  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region $S=\\{z \\in \\mathbb{C}:|z-1| \\leq 2 ;(z+\\bar{z})+i(z-\\bar{z}) \\leq 2, \\operatorname{Im}(z) \\geq 0\\}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "u512b",
      "text": "$\\frac{7 \\pi}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZH8xI",
      "text": "$\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RIjSV",
      "text": "$\\frac{17 \\pi}{8}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Lha8Z",
      "text": "$\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Put $z=x+i y$\n$|z-1| \\leq 2 \\Rightarrow(x-1)^2+y^2 \\leq 4$ ...(i)\n$\\Rightarrow x-y \\leq 1$ ...(ii)\n$\\operatorname{Im}(\\mathrm{z}) \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y} \\geq 0$ ...(iii)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/44NeRiJ51psaA1AJU1-WwgVrc-T_Un6nP6nbucOHcM4.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Required area } \\\\ & =\\text { Area of semi-circle }- \\text { area of sector A } \\\\ & \\frac{1}{2} \\pi(2)^2-\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\\\ & =\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
